&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;Otter.ai turns conversations into knowledge. Millions of people use our AI meeting assistant to capture, transcribe, and act on what&#39;s said in meetings — and we&#39;re the category&#39;s clearest name-brand product. But &quot;clearest name-brand&quot; and &quot;best-known story&quot; aren&#39;t the same thing. As AI note-takers and meeting assistants become table stakes, Otter needs a sharper, more distinctive voice to defend and extend its lead.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring our first Head of Brand &amp;amp; Storytelling to give Otter.ai that voice. This is a builder&#39;s role: you&#39;ll bring structure to a brand promise, tone, and identity that reflect our evolution, and you&#39;ll turn that foundation into the narratives, media moments, and content that make the case — loudly and credibly — that Otter.ai is the category leader.&lt;/p&gt;
You&#39;ll own brand strategy end to end, including PR, communications, social, and community. Leading this small team, you&#39;ll be in the room defining the brand promise&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; in the weeds writing the press release, briefing the analysts, and shipping the social post.
&lt;p&gt;Great storytelling requires great storytellers, words are your passion and you feel at the top of your craft. Knowing how and where those words drive impact is your superpower.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brand strategy &amp;amp; identity:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and codify Otter&#39;s brand promise, personality, tone of voice, and verbal identity system. Make sure it&#39;s usable, not just aspirational (think brand guidelines people actually open).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the internal source of truth on what Otter sounds and feels like, partnering with product, design, and marketing so the brand shows up consistently everywhere — in-product copy, campaigns, sales decks, support, social.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve brand positioning as the category shifts from &quot;meeting transcription&quot; to AI-native conversational intelligence, keeping Otter ahead of where the market is going, not just where it&#39;s been.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy for brand campaigns, working with our in-house creative team and agencies to increase brand awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Narrative &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the core narratives that position Otter.ai as the category leader. A point of view on the future of voice, turning meetings into action, and AI that&#39;s distinct from &quot;another AI notetaker.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive thought leadership (bylines, talk tracks, interviews) that puts Otter&#39;s leadership in front of the right audiences and outlets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn product milestones, customer results, and market moments into stories worth covering — not just announcements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our partnerships team to develop our brand partnership, including sports and 3P events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
PR, communications, social &amp;amp; community:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build out our organic social strategy and execution across channels, with a sharp point of view on which platforms and formats actually move the needle for Otter&#39;s audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and nurture community — the people who already love Otter — into a channel that reinforces the brand and drives organic advocacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose channels based on impact, not habit: know where your audience actually pays attention and put effort there first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand our PR and comms impact: press strategy, media relationships, announcement planning, and (where useful) agency management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a love of their craft. You know the power of the brand and have a passion for making yours stand out in a way that drives impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Showcases proven chops in brand, communications, or integrated marketing roles at B2B SaaS companies, ideally including time at a company under ~$500M ARR where you had to be scrappy and hands-on rather than purely strategic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holds a track record of building or substantially sharpening a brand&#39;s narrative and voice — not just maintaining one you inherited.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can leverage direct experience running PR/comms (media relationships, announcement strategy) and social/community, either as a generalist owner or across multiple prior roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carries strong writing and editing skills; you can produce a sharp press release, a compelling exec byline, and a scroll-stopping social post yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operates with a comfort with ambiguity and a bias to ship: you&#39;d rather put a workable brand framework in front of the team this month than a perfect one next quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is ready to own a function end-to-end and is equally comfortable setting the strategy and rolling up their sleeves to build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Otter.ai&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;We are in the business of shaping the future of work. Our mission is to make conversations more valuable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;With over 1B meetings transcribed,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://otter.ai/&quot;&gt;Otter.ai&lt;/a&gt; is the world’s leading tool for meeting transcription, summarization, and collaboration. Using artificial intelligence, Otter generates real-time automated meeting notes, summaries, and other insights from in-person and virtual meetings - turning meetings into accessible, collaborative, and actionable data that can be shared across teams and organizations. The company is backed by early investors in Google, DeepMind, Zoom, and Tesla.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;Otter.ai is an equal opportunity employer. We proudly celebrate diversity and are committed to building an inclusive and accessible workplace.&amp;nbsp; We provide reasonable accommodations for qualified applicants throughout the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accessibility &amp;amp; Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;Otter.ai is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for candidates with disabilities in our hiring process.&amp;nbsp; If you need assistance or an accommodation during any stage of the recruitment process, please contact hr@otter.ai at least 3 business days before your interview.&lt;/p&gt;
