&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a talented Senior Solution Architect with deep enterprise pre-sales experience who wants to own the technical sale for complex, multi-stakeholder deals and help define how our AI meeting intelligence platform wins against the market&#39;s toughest competitors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical sale in strategic Enterprise accounts ($200K–$1M+ ACV), partnering with Enterprise AEs from first engagement through signed MSA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run sophisticated proof-of-value engagements: you design the evaluation framework, define measurable success criteria, manage the evaluation committee, and convert POV data into a closing business case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and test multi-threaded champion networks within accounts — you don&#39;t rely on a single contact; you map and influence the full buying committee&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate enterprise procurement: MSAs, DPAs, SOC 2 reviews, and security questionnaires are part of your deal, and you manage them proactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape Otter AI&#39;s competitive differentiation strategy — you are the field expert on how to displace Gong, Chorus, and Zoom/Teams AI features in enterprise evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor SA team members and contribute to SA onboarding, demo best practices, and competitive battlecards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Management to translate field insights into roadmap input — your enterprise deals are the most important signal we have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of presales experience in B2B SaaS, with demonstrated success in Enterprise deals ($200K+ ACV) and complex, multi-stakeholder evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep MEDDPICC or MEDDIC fluency — not just familiarity. You use it to qualify, coach your AE, and run retrospectives on lost deals. Explicit MEDDPICC methodology experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve navigated to and influenced C-suite and VP-level economic buyers independently, not just via your AE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth in AI/ML , you can speak credibly to CTOs, data architects, and security teams about LLM behavior, ASR accuracy, API architecture, and enterprise data governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise-grade CRM integrations (Salesforce, specifically): you understand Apex, Connected Apps, data model complexity, and can handle deep-dive technical sessions with Salesforce admins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of competitive displacement — you&#39;ve beaten Gong, Chorus, or enterprise platforms in head-to-head evaluations and you can teach others how&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
