&lt;li&gt;Holds a Bachelor&#39;s, Master&#39;s, or Ph.D. in Computer Science or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates strong expertise in databases, distributed systems, backend performance optimization, and familiarity with backend requirements for machine learning infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates a solid understanding of database internals, transactions, indexing, and experience in schema design optimized for AI data workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has 10+ years of experience in developing and architecting large-scale web services, preferably with exposure to supporting AI systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possesses expert proficiency in Python or other programming languages such as Go, Java, or C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has extensive experience with web frameworks like Django and is comfortable integrating systems with technologies such as MySQL, Redis, Elasticsearch, Kafka, and Cassandra, particularly in support of AI workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
